+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,11 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Enable ``lock_files`` for direct-file edits that must reject concurrent editor
+sessions. Click creates an adjacent hidden lock containing the process and
+timestamp, then removes it when the editor finishes or fails. Temporary-text
+edits are not locked.
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
